  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Goin' Down the Road Feelin' Bad** (1 other source): The Playin' reprise flows into this song, which then segues straight into the Dylan cover A Hard Rain's Gonna Fall [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tuning Jam**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Aiko Aiko**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Minglewood Blues**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Candyman**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Even So**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Bob's Banter to Vote**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Tuning/Jam**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **A Hard Rain's Gonna Fall (B. Dylan)**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2016-07-27.aud-sp-cmc-25.mullen.ll.flac** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 190 min; rated 3.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Downloaded files in various formats play at a slower tempo than the streaming version on the Archive, which sounds fine [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lineup listed: Bob Weir and John Mayer on guitar and vocals, Oteil Burbridge on bass, Jeff Chimenti on keyboards; Mayer and Oteil also on drums [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2016-07-27.aud-sp-cmc-25.mullen.ll.flac**: taped by lvrwm; transferred by lvrwm; source: Audience/SP-CMC-25 mics (Croakies) [1]",
